 <h3><u>Karbala jaana</u></h3> 
 <div style=width:100%> 
  <p></p>
  <p>Karbala jaana, karbala jaana..(2)<br> Kyu itne pareshaa'n ho<br> aye sheh ke azadaro'n<br> kyu thamte nahi aa'nsu<br> kyu chaak gareeba ho<br> jo kaabe ka kaaba hai<br> wo aap ka maula hai<br> wo izn e safar dega<br> koi nahi rokega<br> udte chale jaoge, aisa sukoo'n paoge<br> ghum apne bhulaoge..(2)<br> Dilo ka dard bataana...<br> sab apna haal sunana<br> Karbala jaana, karbala jaana..(4)<br> suno tum karbala jaana</p> 
  <p>1. Laraib yehi sach hai jo karbala jaate hai<br> wo khud se nahi jaate shabbir bulate hai<br> na ye ke bulate hai mehmaan banate hai<br> mehmaan banate hai..(2)<br> naseeb apna jagana...(2)</p> 
  <p>Karbala jaana, karbala jaana..(3)<br> suno tum karbala jaana</p> 
  <p>2. Dil jab ke ziyarat ko har waqt tadapta hai<br> ek aisa waseela hai radd ho nahi sakta hai<br> ghazi ke waseele se, kya kuch nahi milta hai<br> kya kuch nahi milta hai..(2)<br> alam jari ka uthana..(2)</p> 
  <p>Karbala jaana, karbala jaana..(3)<br> suno tum karbala jaana</p> 
  <p>3. Imam e jafar e sadiq ne hai ye farmaya<br> hamare jadd ki ziyarat ko tark naa karna..(2)<br> namak se rotiya khana..(3)</p> 
  <p>Karbala jaana, karbala jaana..(3)<br> suno tum karbala jaana</p> 
  <p>4. Tum kaun ho rutbe ko..(2)<br> khud apne zara samjho<br> shabbir ke naukar ho dar dar pe nahi bhatko<br> duniya se kabhi koi ummeed nahi rakho<br> ummed nahi rakho..(2)<br> mile na koi thikana..(2)</p> 
  <p>Karbala jaana, karbala jaana..(3)<br> suno tum karbala jaana</p> 
  <p>5. Duniya pe nahi rona ye ashk bhi ne'mat ha<br> ho farsh e azaa par to jannat ki zamanat hai<br> aa'nsoo ye azadaro zehra ki amanat hai<br> zehra ki amanat hai..(2)<br> liye hue ye khazana..(2)</p> 
  <p>Karbala jaana, karbala jaana..(3)<br> suno tum karbala jaana</p> 
  <p>6. Suno mai tumko batata hu karbala kya hai<br> ye mariya hai, ye nainawa hai, ye karbala hai<br> ye karbala hai, ye karbala hai, ye karbala hai<br> Ye karbala hai jaha'n lut gaya rasool ka ghar<br> phir ek baar jalaya gaya batool ka ghar<br> &nbsp;<br> jaha'n hussain the pyaase<br> haan karbala wo hai<br> har ek simt the laashe<br> haan karbala wo hai<br> gire zameen pe Akbar<br> haan karbala wo hai<br> tadap gaya jaha'n Asghar<br> haan karbala wo hai</p> 
  <p>Jaha'n pe hogaya tukde hai Qasim e mazloom<br> sitam ki hadd abhi tumko kaha'n hui maloom</p> 
  <p>Yaha'n pe teer chale<br> Yaha'n pe baazu kate<br> yah'n pe khaime jale<br> yaha'n lutey parde</p> 
  <p>Badan hue sabhi pamaal aaye naizo'n pe sar<br> na apne bhai ko ro paayi ek behen muztar</p> 
  <p>Palti hai bahan jis dum zinda se riha hokar<br> Chehlum ki hui majlis shabbir ki turbat par<br> haan sunnate zainab hai ye farsh e ghum e sarwar<br> ye farsh e ghume sarwar..(2)<br> azaa ka farsh bichana..(2)</p> 
  <p>Karbala jaana, karbala jaana..(3)<br> suno tum karbala jaana</p> 
  <p>7. Duniya se mile har dum ghum uske gharane ko<br> deta hai khushi lekin wo saare zamanae ko<br> darr usse nahi behtar ghum apne bhulane ko<br> ghum apne bhulane ko..(2)<br> ghumo ko apne bhulana.(2)</p> 
  <p>Karbala jaana, karbala jaana..(3)<br> suno tum karbala jaana</p> 
  <p>8. Khushiyo'n ka manana bhi fitrat ka taqaza hai<br> sughra ne magar kaise khushiyo'n ko manaya hai<br> sughra ko jo kunbe ka pursa tumhein dena hai<br> pursa tumhe dena hai..(2)<br> ek eid aise manana..(2)</p> 
  <p>Karbala jaana, karbala jaana..(3)<br> suno tum karbala jaana</p> 
  <p>9. Salman ko meesum ko ghum uska rulata hai<br> ek aisi yateema hai jo shaam mein tanha hai<br> tiskeen e dile sarwar, shehzadi ka nauha hai<br> shehzadi ka nauha hai..(2)<br> ghum e sakina sunana..(2)</p> 
  <p>Karbala jaana, karbala jaana..(3)<br> suno tum karbala jaana</p> 
